data.notWritableMsg:
ABS Desktop App can't write to this folder:
{folder}

Move the .exe to a folder you can write to (for example Documents or C:\Tools) and start it again.

temp.msg:
ABS Desktop App was started from a temporary folder that the portable version unpacks itself into:
{folder}

This copy doesn't use your settings and can disappear at any time. Start ABS-DA-Portable.exe from its own folder instead (or with your shortcut or taskbar pin).
